Fantastic Four: Rise of the Silver Surfer is a science fiction,
adventure, action film directed by Tim Story.

3
00:12:32,727 --> 00:12:38,727
The Fantastic Four return to the big screen as a new and
all powerful enemy threatens the Earth.

4
00:16:43,636 --> 00:16:49,636
The seemingly unstoppable 'Silver Surfer', but all is not what it seems and there are old and
new enemies that pose a greater threat than the intrepid superheroes realize.

5
00:20:54,545 --> 00:21:00,545
Reed Richards / Mr. Fantastic, played by Ioan Gruffudd.

6
00:25:05,454 --> 00:25:11,454
Sue Richards / Invisible Woman, played by Jessica Alba.

7
00:29:16,363 --> 00:29:22,363
Johnny Storm / Human Torch, played by Chris Evans.

8
